<title>USA: Stone Energy files for offering.</title>
<headline>Stone Energy files for offering.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone Energy Corp said Friday it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a 3.2 million share offering.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used to repay a term loan, to fund future development projects and acquisitions, and to provide working capital for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The proposed sale is expected to begin in November 1996, the oil and gas company said.</p>
<p>The offering will be led by Salomon Brothers Inc, Johnson Rice &amp; Company LLC and Morgan Keegan &amp; Co Inc, Stone said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
